{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":113360,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793433382818,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/to5FshluwPdO9d3Ucs7fagJL7OU.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2515737","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"営業マンの稜平は、部長からの命令で、社内一の地味子・玲奈が「処女」かどうか聞いてこいと言われ、仕方なく彼女をサシ飲みに誘うことに…!!\n\nだが現れた玲奈はおめかしして別人のように超美人になっていて…!?\n\n可愛過ぎて焦った俺は、ついラブホの前で誘うような台詞を吐いてしまう…!!\n\nだが意外に相手も満更じゃないようで…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7pzvVLFojhYjmm48kJIBv5G51Ij.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7pzvVLFojhYjmm48kJIBv5G51Ij.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2631622","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"熱い夜を共にした2人は、一夜の関係だと割り切ることに。だが大口契約を取った稜平の祝勝会にはなぜか、いつも飲み会に来ないはずの玲奈の姿が…!?\n\nそしてぐでんぐでんに酔わされた稜平を、玲奈が家まで送って介抱してくれる。稜平はそのまま酔った勢いで玲奈をベッドに引き寄せ、「今日は地味だから…」と恥らう彼女の可愛さにたまらず…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fivtqtcRSCGpHqz3ShAmS36e8mZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fivtqtcRSCGpHqz3ShAmS36e8mZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2649657","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"会社のみんなと海に遊びに来た稜平と玲奈。しかし稜平は脚をくじいていて車の中でお留守番、そんな稜平の付き添いをする玲奈と二人っきりの密室状態に…!?\n\nしかも玲奈の水着姿がエロ可愛いすぎて…こんなの我慢できるわけない…!!たまらず車内で身体を重ね合う2人、だがそこへなんと同僚の梨恵がバーベキューを誘いに現れて…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":3.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iEiUKzb7cNHgLyY5aJh67k1DBYz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iEiUKzb7cNHgLyY5aJh67k1DBYz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2666332","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"部長に玲奈のことを聞かれ、「興味ない」と言ってごまかすが、それを当の本人に聞かれてしまった稜平。そこで稜平は、残業で二人っきりになったオフィスで、玲奈に謝ることに。玲奈は「気にしてない」と強がってキスを求めてくるが、その瞳には涙が…!?\n\n玲奈から本当の気持ちを告げられて、覚悟を決める稜平。2人は心も身体もつながろうと、求めるように重なり合って…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":3.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tltkBHxPuTVMKynTflG4ir0245l.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tltkBHxPuTVMKynTflG4ir0245l.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2682395","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついに正式なお付き合いをすることになった2人。お外で初デートをした帰り、雨が降ってきたのでラブホに避難することに。そこで遊び疲れを癒すため、玲奈にマッサージをしてあげる稜平。\n\nだが玲奈の気持ちよさそうな顔を見ていたら、どうにもたまらなくなってきてしまい…!?電動マッサージ機で際どいところをほぐしていくと…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":2.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gSoIPD9gevuaNCyEEwP6tNNkrtM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gSoIPD9gevuaNCyEEwP6tNNkrtM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2703938","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"会議室で二人っきりになった稜平と玲奈。だが玲奈は、さっき稜平と梨恵が楽しそうに話しているの見てしまい、ヤキモチを焼いてくる。そんな玲奈がかわいくて愛おしく思った稜平は、つい股間を膨らませてしまう…!?\n\n仕事中なのに…高まる感情を抑えきれず、声を殺してつながる2人。だけどこのままもし誰か来てしまったら…ヤバすぎる…!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":3.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dPy61hn0Wu5J3JO029XCuJRaw8a.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dPy61hn0Wu5J3JO029XCuJRaw8a.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2725127","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"梨恵と付き合っているという噂が立ち、勘違いから玲奈に突然別れを告げられた稜平。何も知らない稜平は、その一方的な別れ話に怒って、「なら最後に好きに抱かせてよ」と玲奈に過激なプレイを要求する…。\n\nいつもと違うドSでイジワルな責めで、何かを忘れるためかのように快楽をむさぼる稜平。だがその心には、どこか玲奈への罪悪感があって…","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":1.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5C0ufGQqWOuBmDXboNpzpdbljGO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5C0ufGQqWOuBmDXboNpzpdbljGO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2741493","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"玲奈と別れて落ち込む稜平。そんな時に梨恵から食事に誘われ、気分転換にと行くことに。そこで梨恵からやんわりと口説かれる稜平だが、思い出すのは玲奈のことばかり…。「俺、やっぱり君のことが好きなんだ…」自分の本当の気持ちに気付いた稜平は、玲奈に会うため夜の街を駆け出して…。身体から始まった恋が今、心からの愛に変わる…感動の最終回!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aBpMMyOLoJbtcThgbSeWs21laQG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aBpMMyOLoJbtcThgbSeWs21laQG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1/episode/8"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113360/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793433382818,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793433382818,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793433382818,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793433